  "notes": "Logo: logo-dark.svg is the colour version (blue and sand) of the header logo; the header's default logo.svg is all white, for use over photos. Videos come from the operator's own YouTube channel (Blue Dolphin Marine Tours), linked from the footer of every page; titles taken from the channel feed. There are 15 videos on the channel, mostly 2018 whale clips; the 2023 promo is first. No videos are embedded in the site pages. Trip photos use the full-size files (the pages show 740x555 crops); every URL answered 200. Bec2-3.jpg full size is about 11 MB. Left out: the skipper and owner portraits (Peter-Lynch.jpg, Pete-Jodie.jpg, staff photos), the TripAdvisor award badge, eco certification logo, a box-wine graphic, the SVG feature icons, and 8.jpg, which is only in the pages' structured data and not shown. Breach-M-Seabury.jpg on the whale page is named for a person (likely a guest photographer); no credit shows on the page. The sitemap's gallery-2 to gallery-8 and portfolio-8 pages are empty placeholders; the real gallery is /gallery/. The Rezdy booking iframe was not opened."
